  "translate_en|mods/ErgonomicUI/common/media/lua/shared/Translate/EN/UI.json|UI_ErgUI_label_0_983": "Writing on a bullet-pocked wall, release v0.983",
  "translate_en|mods/ErgonomicUI/common/media/lua/shared/Translate/EN/UI.json|UI_ErgUI_label_0_99": "A signed postcard, release v0.99",
  "translate_en|mods/ErgonomicUI/common/media/lua/shared/Translate/EN/UI.json|UI_ErgUI_label_0_991": "A coffee-stained sheet of paper, release 0.991",
  "translate_en|mods/ErgonomicUI/common/media/lua/shared/Translate/EN/UI.json|UI_ErgUI_label_0_992": "Writing on a computer box, release 0.992",
  "translate_en|mods/ErgonomicUI/common/media/lua/shared/Translate/EN/UI.json|UI_ErgUI_label_0_993": "A stack of cards with notes on release 0.993",
  "translate_en|mods/ErgonomicUI/common/media/lua/shared/Translate/EN/UI.json|UI_ErgUI_text_0_983": "The option to auto-hide the panel while aiming has been added. Enabled by default. Can be disabled in the settings.<LINE><LINE>Red highlighting of containers has been added when it's impossible to drop items into them. Overall, the quick-drop drop-down list has been improved.<LINE><LINE>Compatibility with mods that create hidden items in the inventory has been improved.<LINE><LINE>The option to automatically show the panel next to containers has been removed.<LINE><LINE>Still alive, RuslanARG",
  "translate_en|mods/ErgonomicUI/common/media/lua/shared/Translate/EN/UI.json|UI_ErgUI_text_0_99": "The BODY module has been added - protection and health readings per body part. The gear comparison mechanic is built into it. The health readings can be turned off. I am still drawing the detailed injury art and will add it in future updates, so for now it is just a fill over the body part.<LINE><LINE>The GEAR window has been reworked. The pluggable modules are shown in a single window. I recommend combining the [window auto-size] button with turning modules on and off.<LINE><LINE>The window control panel has been changed - the [S] button or a right click on a window. New features have been added to it.<LINE><LINE>A full window lock has been added. The padlock icon locks every window and its size.<LINE><LINE>Compatibility with other storage mods has been improved, and a compatibility patch for Smarter Storage has been added. Plus a whole pile of fixes and small corrections.<LINE><LINE>I know I sometimes change mechanics you have already got used to. I try to weigh every decision carefully. The mod is getting close to version 1, and there will be no such drastic changes from here on.<LINE><LINE>Still alive, RuslanARG",
  "translate_en|mods/ErgonomicUI/common/media/lua/shared/Translate/EN/UI.json|UI_ErgUI_text_0_991": "New:<LINE>- Item search by name and type (can be turned off in the [S] panel).<LINE>- The quick transfer column is now a module with three modes: Off / Simple / Full. Full is a new look with a card for the target container (name, weight, contents) and a quantity picker - give it a try in the settings.<LINE>- Reordering bar buttons and containers is now just hold right mouse button and drag (the hotkey is no longer needed and has been removed). A magnetised group of windows can also be dragged with the right button by its header.<LINE>- The double click action in the world window is now a choice: Take (as in vanilla) or Use (Ergonomic).<LINE>- BODY module: new readings - discomfort, running, vision, hearing (both ways: penalty and bonus); weight of equipped items; a weight switch on the doll.<LINE>- Weight buttons: contents weight, total carried weight, weight of equipped items.<LINE>- A fourth accent colour - white.<LINE>- Caught and fixed a long-standing bug where items got stuck in the hands and a drop reported x5 - a ghost stack left over from a previous transfer.<LINE><LINE>IMPORTANT: returning removed clothing to its original container now always works (the option has been taken out of the settings).<LINE><LINE>Still alive, RuslanARG",
  "translate_en|mods/ErgonomicUI/common/media/lua/shared/Translate/EN/UI.json|UI_ErgUI_text_0_992": "Category drag. Hold the right mouse button on an item and drag: the whole category of items is picked up.<LINE>- Dropping on the seam between categories changes the order they are shown in the inventory. Drag towards the border between categories.<LINE>- Dropping on the quick transfer column, on the floor or into the neighbouring window moves the items.<LINE>- A single right click on an item still opens the standard item menu.<LINE><LINE>Still alive, RuslanARG",
  "translate_en|mods/ErgonomicUI/common/media/lua/shared/Translate/EN/UI.json|UI_ErgUI_text_0_993": "The new \"Cards\" view. There are now three ways to show items: icons, list, cards. The extra buttons [1][2][3][4] switch the number of card columns.<LINE><LINE>Range select from an anchor has been added. The Shift key, works in every view and in the gear window.<LINE>- Shift + click sets the anchor: a separate frame appears on the item, so it is clear where the selection starts from.<LINE>- The next Shift + click adds every item between the anchor and the click to the selection.<LINE>- Ranges combine with Ctrl selection and the marquee: everything piles into one batch.<LINE>- A plain click clears both the selection and the anchor.<LINE><LINE>The auto-scroll during a drag select has been improved: the further the cursor goes past the window edge, the faster it scrolls (before there was a single speed).<LINE><LINE>A \"Highlight items on the ground\" toggle has been added, switched on in the panel settings.<LINE><LINE>The total weight of a selection in the inventory has been fixed: the number no longer runs over the neighbouring button.<LINE><LINE>Some of the default settings have been rebuilt so that the starting look of the panel is closer to vanilla. This is to help new players settle into Ergonomic UI without dumping every feature on them at once.<LINE><LINE>Still alive, RuslanARG",
  "translate_en|mods/ErgonomicUI/common/media/lua/shared/Translate/EN/UI.json|UI_optionscreen_binding_ErgUI_MultiSelect": "Multi-select (hold)",
  "translate_en|mods/ErgonomicUI/common/media/lua/shared/Translate/EN/UI.json|UI_optionscreen_binding_ErgUI_QuickLoot": "Quick Loot (hold + click)",
  "translate_en|mods/ErgonomicUI/common/media/lua/shared/Translate/EN/UI.json|UI_optionscreen_binding_ErgUI_ToggleExpandP": "Inventory window auto-size",
  "translate_en|mods/ErgonomicUI/common/media/lua/shared/Translate/EN/UI.json|UI_optionscreen_binding_ErgUI_ToggleExpandW": "World window auto-size",
  "translate_en|mods/ErgonomicUI/common/media/lua/shared/Translate/EN/UI.json|UI_optionscreen_binding_ErgUI_ToggleInfoZone": "Gear window auto-size",
  "translate_en|mods/ErgonomicUI/common/media/lua/shared/Translate/EN/UI.json|UI_optionscreen_binding_ErgUI_TogglePanel": "Panel Show/Hide",
  "translate_en|mods/ErgonomicUI/common/media/lua/shared/Translate/EN/UI.json|UI_optionscreen_binding_ErgonomicUI": "ErgonomicUI"
}
